==================================================
1. PRODUCT VISION
==================================================

Factory Memory OS is an intelligent digital operations platform designed to modernize how manufacturing factories record, organize, retrieve, and analyze operational information.

Many factories depend on physical logbooks, paper reports, handwritten measurements, manual calculations, and information passed verbally between workers.

Important information can become difficult to retrieve when records are scattered across different departments and notebooks.

Factory Memory OS will provide one centralized digital system where authorized factory personnel can record and access operational information.

The system should digitize:

- Production records.
- Material identification and measurements.
- Material weights and quantities.
- Machine information.
- Machine breakdowns.
- Electrical maintenance records.
- Mechanical maintenance records.
- Preventive maintenance schedules.
- Spare parts usage.
- Machine downtime.
- Production waste.
- Quality control records.
- Shift handovers.
- Daily departmental reports.
- Factory operational history.

The application must also include an AI assistant capable of searching the factory's recorded information using natural language.

LONG-TERM VISION:

Become the digital memory and intelligence layer for manufacturing companies.

