15. FACTORY MEMORY AI
==================================================

This is one of the most important features.

Build an AI-powered assistant called:

FACTORY MEMORY AI

PURPOSE:

Allow authorized factory personnel to retrieve information from the factory database using normal conversational language.

Instead of manually searching through multiple logbooks, workers should be able to ask questions.

EXAMPLE QUESTIONS:

"Show me all electrical faults reported this week."

"When was the last time this machine experienced a sensor failure?"

"Which machine had the highest downtime last month?"

"What action was taken during the previous heater failure?"

"Show me all maintenance activities completed yesterday."

"How many times has this machine broken down this month?"

"Which spare parts were used during the last maintenance?"

"Show me the previous shift's electrical maintenance report."

"What materials were inspected yesterday?"

"What was the recorded thickness of material batch 204?"

"Show me all production records for the previous month."

"Which maintenance reports are still awaiting approval?"

"Summarize the electrical department's activities this week."

AI CAPABILITIES:

1. Natural language search.
2. Historical record retrieval.
3. Machine maintenance history.
4. Material record retrieval.
5. Production record retrieval.
6. Report summarization.
7. Trend identification.
8. Cross-department information retrieval where permissions allow.
9. Comparison of historical records.
10. Identification of missing or incomplete records.

AI RESPONSE REQUIREMENTS:

- Retrieve answers from actual database records.
- Display the relevant dates and record references.
- Identify which records support the answer.
- Never invent missing information.
- Clearly state when information is unavailable.
- Distinguish recorded facts from AI-generated observations.
- Respect user permissions.
- Never expose another factory's data.
- Never modify operational records without explicit authorization.

IMPORTANT:

AI must not independently diagnose electrical faults or recommend unsafe electrical procedures.

It must not control machines, change temperature settings, operate electrical equipment, or make safety-critical decisions.

The assistant is an information retrieval and analytical tool.

If a historical event was never recorded or digitized, the AI must not pretend it can recover it.

